# Runtime data — study results (SUS), in-app feedback, telemetry, verifier
# runs, generated artifacts, saved domains, and their images. Owned by the
# DEPLOYED SERVER and must NOT be tracked, so `git pull` / deploys never
# overwrite real participant data. Keep a backup of this dir on the server.
# On a fresh clone it starts empty; the app re-creates it on first write.
